        "source_sha256": "87ad285905790b835c40ab6834e569e8648e83ebe91020f96d6e3a54c49e3ba7",
        "text": "PATRICIA MUGA for ASSEMBLY DISTRICT 20\n# Welcome to the FIGHT!\nCalifornia is the Greatest State in the Nation!\nSacramento politicians continue to degrade Our Quality of Life. Their support of laws and regulations designed to advance Global Interests and Corporate Elites, are destroying Our Communities and Future.\nDonate to the CampaignThe Issues\nThe Case for Change\n## Consider Another Way\nAre YOU TIRED of watching the Destruction of ALL we hold dear? Community is built upon open discussion and good faith negotiations, NOT backroom deals with entrenched special interests.\nSacramento is Broken! One Party controls a SUPER majority of Our Legislature. This means if YOU ARE NOT HAPPY with the 'state' of California or your prospects for a prosperous future here in the greatest state in this country, YOU HAVE ONLY ONE PARTY TO THANK!\nRead the full platform →\n### Endorsed by:\n..................................... additionally endorsed by common sense Democrats & “Stevie” 🐾\nMy Story\nI used to be a registered Democrat and Union Member. I used to be a registered No Party Preference voter. I am now a registered Republican because I clearly see the way organized labor, corporate interests, and corrupt powerful actors dominate our government and advance policies contrary to the public interest.\nGood government requires DIALOGUE. Government MUST be transparent and responsive to the people it serves.\nJoin me and countless Californians in the fight for OUR HOME.\nJoin Us on the Road to the Assembly!\nDonate to Our Campaign\n## Donate to Our Campaign\nYour support and contributions will enable us to meet our goals and fund the campaign.\nDonateAbout Patricia\nGet Involved\n## Contact Us at 925-551-1734 or..\nDrop us a line!",
        "text_limited": false,
        "title": "Patricia Muga for Assembly District 20 | Muga for Assembly",
